    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buno n'obukwenda bwa Musengwa Katonda obugema ku Isiraeli. Musengwa Katonda oyo n'eyabambagho eigulu, yaatonda n'ensi, era yaagha abantu obulamu. Era akoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bona eno, ndifuula Yerusalemu kyaba ng'oti kikopo kya mwenge gwa mizabbibu. Abantu ab'amaghanga agakyezungulwire balikinhwa kyabaleetera okutagala ng'oti batamiivu. Era abazigu bwe balizingiza Yerusalemu, balizingiza n'ebibuga eby'omu Buyudaaya byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo ndireetera Yerusalemu okuba ng'oti n'eibaale eizito, nga kiisi ighanga erigezaaku okulibbeeda, lirumizibwa inho. Era amaghanga goonagoona ag'oku nsi galyeyimba gaakirumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo ndireetera embalaasi dhoonadhoona okutya einho, dhaagwamu akatambala, era naaleetera n'abavuzi baadho okugwa eiralu. Ndirabirira abantu b'omu Buyudaaya, aye naaleetera embalaasi edh'abazigu baibwe okutulughala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abantu b'omu bika bya Buyudaaya balikoba mule bati, ‘Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, agha abantu be ab'omu Yerusalemu amaani.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu kiseera ekyo ndireetera ebika eby'omu Buyudaaya okuba ng'oti n'omuliro gwe bakunaaniiza mu mmungo y'enku, oba mu binhwa by'engaano. Birizikiriza amaghanga goonagoona agabyezungulwire agho. Aye abantu b'omu Yerusalemu balisigala nga ghazira kabi kabatuuseeku naire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nze Musengwa Katonda ndisooka kuleetera magye ga Buyudaaya okughangula, olwo ekitiisa baidhukulu ba Daudi n'abantu b'omu Yerusalemu kye balifuna, kirobe kusinga ekyo abantu b'omu Buyudaaya abandi boonaboona kye balifuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo nze Musengwa Katonda ndikuuma abantu b'omu Yerusalemu, kyaba nti ole aliba nga n'asembayo kuba munafu mu abo, alifuuka wa maani ng'oti ni Daudi bwe yali. Era baidhukulu ba Daudi oyo n'abalibakulemberamu ng'oti ni malaika wa Musengwa Katonda, era ng'oti ni Katonda mwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyo ndizikiriza kiisi ighanga eririgezaaku okulumba Yerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
